---
description: Clean Architecture + Cubit rules for this Flutter repo
globs: lib/**/*.dart
alwaysApply: true
---
Same rules as CLAUDE.md (single source of truth — keep them in sync):

- Layers: `features/<f>/{domain,data,presentation}`; domain is pure Dart.
- Data sources throw `AppException`; repositories return `Result<T>`
  (`Success` / `Failed(Failure)`); UI never sees Dio.
- Cubit by default; immutable Equatable states; `if (isClosed) return;`
  after every await before emit.
- Tokens only via `TokenStorage`. Never log headers/body.
- `package:` imports only. Keys on interactive widgets: `Key('<f>_<el>')`.
- Figma MCP output (React/Tailwind) is a spec, not code: rebuild with
  Flutter layout widgets; colors/text/spacing from `ThemeData`, no inline
  hex or absolute positioning.
- Don't edit `*.g.dart` / `*.freezed.dart`.
